  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diamond Touch Cashew Nut Value Addition Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will strengthen the management and operational capacity of the organization to effectively purchase raw cashew nuts and process them into various products for the market. The organization will be supported with working capital; a 3 ton truck, generator; staff and farmer trainings; technical assistance and administrative support.</narrative>
  </description>
